WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:05.672
Pick a starter from the plus button. It opens in a new tab.

2
00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:10.000
Switch tabs. Each one keeps its own graph.

3
00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:13.176
Press F2 to rename a tab.

4
00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:19.010
Done with one? Close it.

5
00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:23.657
On a phone, your tabs fold into one menu.
